Project Details

Project Title
Kannada Morphological Analyser and Generator Using Deep Learning

Introduction
This project explores morphological analysis and word generation for the Kannada language. Morphological analysis identifies a word's root and grammatical components, such as suffixes. Morphological generation aims to form words using a root and grammatical information.

Objectives
- Study Kannada word structure.
- Understand root words and suffixes.
- Explore deep learning approaches for Kannada Natural Language Processing (NLP).
- Document analysis and generation methods.

Language
Kannada

Domain
Natural Language Processing (NLP) and Deep Learning

